WEBVTT

00:50:57.028 --> 00:51:00.498
That is deeply, profoundly unfair.

00:51:00.522 --> 00:51:03.523
And part of you -- I mean,
tell me if I'm wrong on this --

00:51:03.547 --> 00:51:08.888
but part of you, at least for me,
part of the salve has to be

00:51:08.912 --> 00:51:12.191
to say that there just has to be
random evil out there.

00:51:12.215 --> 00:51:16.792
Your worldview has to include
the possibility for random evil.

00:51:16.816 --> 00:51:21.695
Like, if this was someone's intention,
that seems too much.

00:51:21.719 --> 00:51:25.258
For me, that was the distancing mechanism,

00:51:25.282 --> 00:51:28.248
to say, for all the wonder
and enchantment in the world,

00:51:28.272 --> 00:51:29.826
there is random evil,

00:51:29.850 --> 00:51:31.178
and you'd better know it.